# Generated by `npm run build:pdf-functions` (esbuild, JSX-stripped from
# pdf.tsx/pdfGeneration.tsx) so Vercel's Node.js Function runtime — which
# resolves imports as native ESM and needs plain .js on disk — never has
# to transpile JSX itself. Always regenerated by `npm run build`; never
# hand-edited, never the source of truth.
